    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output: Batumi-Sarpi road constructed 
Indicator: About 11.00 km of road, including a 1.47 km bridge over the Chorokhi River and 7.60 km tunnel, constructed to 90 km/hour design standard on a new alignment with enhanced safety features 
Progress/Status: IFB for civil works was posted on 5 Nov 2025 with submission deadline on 10 Feb 2026.

Contracts for (i) National Environment Specialist and (ii) National Project Implementation Specialist have been awarded in December 2025. 
Data Source: Project progress and completion reports 
